na bzrúnnuju'?","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"¿Bizra guca chiu', xe̱gu Jordán, lawe' da be̱n na gugú'?","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Le'e, xi'a zri'a ca', ¿Bizr chee̱ na' guxrítele ca dxelexrite","poem":1},{"text":"chivo ca'?","poem":2},{"text":"Le'e, xi'adu ca', ¿Bizr chee̱ na' guxrítele ca dxelexrite","poem":1},{"text":"chíbudu ca'?","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"Dxezrize xe̱zr la xu lau Xránadxu Dios, lau Dios chee̱ Jacob.","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Dios nigá be̱ne̱' bexaca xiaj xre' tu beaj nisa,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"na' bexaca xiaj tu ga dxalaj nisa.","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/zat_wbt/PSA/114.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/zat_wbt/PSA/115.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/zat_wbt/PSA/113.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}